am/apps/2353220/extras/3f62685858e61cc2fbe783428a406b96.mp4?t=1758848462\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are <strong>Captain Hale,</strong> a war-hero and frontiersman based by the remote Legion outpost of <strong>Fort Ninevus.</strong> Accompanying you is your trusty sidekick (and ex-girlfriend) <strong>Meredith von Mhyr</strong>, a sexy half-elven paladin. She's your confidante, best friend, and occasional lover...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2353220/extras/b299fb28f4c4ea888db451aee89f117e.avif?t=1758848462\" width=800 height=376 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Together you guard the frontier from threats, including the greenskins hordes... then spend quality time together when you're not busy adventuring or handling diplomatic matters! \u2665</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2353220/extras/47f31ed8d6690a0933f190e268f7a45e.avif?t=1758848462\" data-has-big width=800 height=230 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2353220/extras/b56311b773b36c6428e2a31ed2851d5b.poster.avif?t=1758848462\" width=800 height=96 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2353220/extras/b56311b773b36c6428e2a31ed2851d5b.webm?t=1758848462\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2353220/extras/b56311b773b36c6428e2a31ed2851d5b.mp4?t=1758848462\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The recent crises have left women alone and fearful. Many have lost their husbands, fathers, brothers, and are in desperate need of a strong man! Help them with their troubles or offer them a shoulder to cry on, and you'll soon find them inviting you into their bed! Sleep with them, or refuse their advances while choosing material rewards over sexual gratification.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2353220/extras/de421c77dda0964d82d8bec0cc6b552a.avif?t=1758848462\" width=1560 height=880 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dominant / Romantic / Submissive</strong> paths have also been woven into encounters to further spice them up! You can choose <strong>Maledom / Romance / Femdom</strong> to resolve some quests via sex! This won't always be the case, but it's present often enough to give you a fun sense of progression and freedom in how you handle things... along some extra spicy sex-scenes!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2353220/extras/198ff3aebcbcb4bea037436726614036.avif?t=1758848462\" width=1560 height=880 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And for those truly special encounters, there's also a unique tier of adult scene in the form of <strong>CYOA books!</strong> These lengthy encounters are reserved for story characters, and offer branching paths that allow you to pick and choose how you navigate the lewd scene! Whether you're after kinky sex or gentle lovemaking, the <strong>CYOA</strong> storybooks have something for everyone!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2353220/extras/14cff5cc56e7ff937b7852638e93bd75.avif?t=1758848462\" width=1560 height=878 /></s