462\" width=800 height=96 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2353220/extras/3f62685858e61cc2fbe783428a406b96.webm?t=1758848462\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2353220/extras/3f62685858e61cc2fbe783428a406b96.mp4?t=1758848462\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are <strong>Captain Hale,</strong> a war-hero and frontiersman based by the remote Legion outpost of <strong>Fort Ninevus.</strong> Accompanying you is your trusty sidekick (and ex-girlfriend) <strong>Meredith von Mhyr</strong>, a sexy half-elven paladin. She's your confidante, best friend, and occasional lover...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2353220/extras/b299fb28f4c4ea888db451aee89f117e.avif?t=1758848462\" width=800 height=376 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Together you guard the frontier from threats, including the greenskins hordes... then spend quality time together when you're not busy adventuring or handling diplomatic matters! \u2665</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2353220/extras/47f31ed8d6690a0933f190e268f7a45e.avif?t=1758848462\" data-has-big width=800 height=230 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2353220/extras/b56311b773b36c6428e2a31ed2851d5b.poster.avif?t=1758848462\" width=800 height=96 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2353220/extras/b56311b773b36c6428e2a31ed2851d5b.webm?t=1758848462\" type=\"vid