yone!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2353220/extras/14cff5cc56e7ff937b7852638e93bd75.avif?t=1758848462\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2353220/extras/5b380eca147b1a8d8b315483a54e0949.poster.avif?t=1758848462\" width=800 height=96 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2353220/extras/5b380eca147b1a8d8b315483a54e0949.webm?t=1758848462\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2353220/extras/5b380eca147b1a8d8b315483a54e0949.mp4?t=1758848462\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2353220/extras/a4a5ac03560f0fb7c2d5c4e6558d189c.avif?t=1758848462\" width=800 height=304 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Apart from its lewd content, the game offers robust role-playing opportunities, letting you pick from many choices that allow you to leave your mark on the world! Will you become a courageous crusader? A depraved lecher? A foolhardy drunkard? An oppressive tyrant? Or maybe something in between? The choice is always yours... along with the consequences of your actions! <strong>Archetypes</strong> let you decide what <i>kind</i> of <strong>Captain Hale</strong> you want to play as! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2353220/extras/75ca4e3ae4abc54d01030d9a661c3ee3.avif?t=1758848